    description: "Synthetic identity fraud has grown with generative AI: attackers now use AI tools to fabricate passports, driver's licenses, and ID cards realistic enough to pass human review during account onboarding. These documents typically combine genuine template designs with AI-generated portraits and carefully altered metadata to evade manual checks. OPSWAT AI Content Inspector analyzes the document for AI-generation fingerprints — inconsistencies in text rendering, image artifacts, and metadata anomalies — and flags it before it reaches KYC or onboarding workflows. The demo uses a clearly synthetic ID card, so no real identity data is involved.",
